$\n\nFrom the first equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\overset{―}{k}=6-6\\text{i}\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into the second equation, we obtain the true statement\n\n$$\n(3-2\\text{i})(6-6\\text{i})=6-30\\text{i}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $k=\\overset{―}{6-6\\text{i}}=6+6\\text{i}.$\n\nFinally, $\\text{Re}(k)=6.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-130893/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3eaed693-68df-5da8-942d-408d6871358a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-130893"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-130898/selection/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490" :answer/id #uuid "330ea075-87da-5fd6-af52-72f9bd16ca3a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130898/selection/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" :answer/id #uuid "d70a987d-b696-582b-8168-41aa0ded3723" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130898/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "2326a24d-2afb-5aa6-aefa-252d646f45a0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130898/selection/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" :answer/id #uuid "ec6aa73c-1ba6-54e4-8512-af22cab39c4e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130898/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "59050ad0-fbeb-50d5-b81b-c1339f36905f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130898/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "fbba9145-405d-58f6-b3ba-4e02c3930e44" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-130898/selection/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac0410301